text.en:
The territorial jurisdiction of the said Municipality of Don Mariano Marcos shall be bounded as
"Beginning at a point marked "1" on the Reference Map, being on the intersection between the Provincial
Boundary of Misamis Occidental and Zamboanga del Norte, and the present boundary of Concepcion and
Aloran, all of Misamis Occidental;
Thence East 8,300.00 meters to point 2;
Thence North 200.00 meters to point 3;
Thence N. 74° 29 ‘E 3,736.00 meters to point 4;
Thence South 25,000.00 meters to point 5;
Thence West 11,900.00 meters to point 6;
Thence North 23,800.00 meters to point of beginning",
containing an area of twenty eight thousand, four hundred fifty-five (28,455) hectares, more or less, with all
points marked on the ground by P.B.M. concrete monuments.
